    "paclet:EricJamesParfitt/CyclicTagCompiler/ref/\
ObliviousRingMachineToNaryCyclicTagRule"]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
  "8f7d3c89-6f72-a244-8466-66b446dfe725"],
 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->339155038, ExpressionUUID->"9811c244-bdf3-2844-8bfe-99ec906f37ef"]
